    "response_text": "[{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"role\":\"model\",\"parts\":[{\"thought\":true,\"text\":\"**Drafting dependency functions**\\n\\nI'm currently working on a Nix file, specifically `tools/rust/crane-lib/dependency-resolution.nix`. My focus right now is on defining functions to handle dependency resolution. I'm starting by outlining the structure, including the `lib'`, `crateCargoToml`, and `workspaceCargoToml` inputs.\\n\\n\\n\"}]}}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"trafficType\":\"ON_DEMAND\"},\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\"},{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"role\":\"model\",\"parts\":[{\"thought\":true,\"text\":\"**Refining dependency logic**\\n\\nI'm now diving into the `getMemberDeps` function within `dependency-resolution.nix`. I'm focusing on the logic that identifies and filters local, workspace dependencies. Currently, I'm working to refine the checks to ensure only relevant dependencies are included and to prevent infinite recursion.\\n\\n\\n\"}]},\"citationMetadata\":{\"citations\":[{\"startIndex\":770,\"endIndex\":1307,\"uri\":\"https://github.daw.org.cn/unionlabs/union/blob/main/tools/rust/crane.nix\"}]}}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"trafficType\":\"ON_DEMAND\"},\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\"},{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"role\":\"model\",\"parts\":[{\"thought\":true,\"text\":\"**Constructing the initial file**\\n\\nOkay, I've started building the `dependency-resolution.nix` file. I'm focusing on the `getMemberDeps` and `getAllDeps` functions. I've begun defining the inputs, `lib'`, `crateCargoToml`, and `workspaceCargoToml`. The `getMemberDeps` function is being implemented to recursively identify path dependencies within the workspace.\\n\\n\\n\"}]}}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"trafficType\":\"ON_DEMAND\"},\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\"},{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"role\":\"model\",\"parts\":[{\"thought\":true,\"text\":\"**Initializing dependency functions**\\n\\nI've successfully created the `dependency-resolution.nix` file now, and I'm currently defining the initial structure. I've included `getMemberDeps` and `getAllDeps` functions. The `getMemberDeps` function is specifically designed to recursively identify local (path) dependencies.\\n\\n\\n\"}]}}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"trafficType\":\"ON_DEMAND\"},\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\"},{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"role\":\"model\",\"parts\":[{\"thoughtSignature\":\"\",\"functionCall\":{\"name\":\"write_file\",\"args\":{\"content\":\"\\n{ lib', crateCargoToml, workspaceCargoToml, ... }:\\n\\nlet\\n  # gets all the local (i.e. path) dependencies for a crate, recursively.\\n  #\\n  # note that to make this easier, we define all local dependencies as workspace dependencies.\\n  #\\n  # sig :: [string] -> bool -> [string]\\n  getMemberDeps =\\n    dirs: dontRemoveDevDeps:\\n    let\\n      go =\\n        dir': foundSoFar:\\n        let\\n          dirCargoToml = crateCargoToml dir';\\n        in\\n        lib'.pipe\\n          (\\n            dirCargoToml.dependencies\\n            // (lib'.optionalAttrs dontRemoveDevDeps dirCargoToml.dev-dependencies or { })\\n            // dirCargoToml.build-dependencies or { }\\n          )\\n          [\\n            (lib'.filterAttrs (\\n              dependency: value:\\n              # ...and dep is a workspace dependency...\\n              (value.workspace or false)\\n              # ...and that workspace dependency is a path dependency...\\n              && (builtins.hasAttr \\\"path\\\" workspaceCargoToml.workspace.dependencies.${dependency})\\n              # ...and that workspace dependency has not been found yet (to prevent infinite recursion)\\n              && !(builtins.elem workspaceCargoToml.workspace.dependencies.${dependency}.path foundSoFar)\\n            ))\\n            (lib'.mapAttrsToList (\\n              name: _value:\\n              let\\n                inherit (workspaceCargoToml.workspace.dependencies.${name}) path;\\n              in\\n              (go path (lib'.unique (foundSoFar ++ [ path ]))) ++ [ path ]\\n            ))\\n            (lib'.concat [ dir' ])\\n            lib'.flatten\\n            lib'.unique\\n          ];\\n    in\\n    lib'.unique (lib'.flatten (builtins.map (dir: go dir [ ]) dirs));\\n\\n  # gets all the dependencies for a crate, recursively.\\n  #\\n  # sig :: [string] -> bool -> [string]\\n  getAllDeps =\\n    dirs: dontRemoveDevDeps:\\n    lib'.pipe (getMemberDeps dirs dontRemoveDevDeps) [\\n      (map (\\n        path:\\n        ((crateCargoToml path).dependencies or { })\\n        // (lib'.optionalAttrs dontRemoveDevDeps (crateCargoToml path).dev-dependencies or { })\\n        // ((crateCargoToml path).build-dependencies or { })\\n      ))\\n      (builtins.foldl' lib'.recursiveUpdate { })\\n    ];\\n\\nin\\n{\\n  inherit getMemberDeps getAllDeps;\\n}\\n\",\"file_path\":\"/data/data/com.termux.nix/files/home/pick-up-nix2/vendor/nix/union/tools/rust/crane-lib/dependency-resolution.nix\"}}}]},\"finishReason\":\"STOP\"}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"promptTokenCount\":36883,\"candidatesTokenCount\":620,\"totalTokenCount\":38153,\"cachedContentTokenCount\":35362,\"trafficType\":\"ON_DEMAND\",\"promptTokensDetails\":[{\"modality\":\"TEXT\",\"tokenCount\":36883}],\"cacheTokensDetails\":[{\"modality\":\"TEXT\",\"tokenCount\":35362}],\"candidatesTokensDetails\":[{\"modality\":\"TEXT\",\"tokenCount\":620}],\"thoughtsTokenCount\":650},\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\"}]",
