    "response_text": "[{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"role\":\"model\",\"parts\":[{\"thought\":true,\"text\":\"**Developing Clean Source Code**\\n\\nI'm currently working on `tools/rust/crane-lib/mkCleanSrc.nix`. I'm starting to flesh out the core functionality, focusing on how `mkCleanSrc` will handle workspace members and any additional includes to create a clean source environment. This involves leveraging existing Nix packages and the `lib` functions to ensure accuracy.\\n\\n\\n\"}]}}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"trafficType\":\"ON_DEMAND\"},\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\"},{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"role\":\"model\",\"parts\":[{\"thought\":true,\"text\":\"**Refining `mkCleanSrc` Function**\\n\\nNow, I'm diving into the `mkCleanSrc` function definition within `tools/rust/crane-lib/mkCleanSrc.nix`. I've added the initial structure with input arguments for workspace members, extra includes, and the cargo-related paths. I'm focusing on defining the assertions to validate the inputs and beginning the `filteredSrc` logic, especially how to include files and filter them correctly. The aim is to accurately create the clean source.\\n\\n\\n\"}]}}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"trafficType\":\"ON_DEMAND\"},\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\"},{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"role\":\"model\",\"parts\":[{\"thought\":true,\"text\":\"**Defining the Function Logic**\\n\\nI'm now in the process of defining the actual logic within the `mkCleanSrc` function in `tools/rust/crane-lib/mkCleanSrc.nix`. I've added a few assertions to validate inputs and am beginning to construct the core of the `filteredSrc` attribute. I'm focusing on how to use `fs.toSource`, `fs.union`, and `fs.difference` in order to correctly include and exclude the files. In addition to this, I'm integrating `cargoLock` and `cargoToml` for further configuration.\\n\\n\\n\"}]}}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"trafficType\":\"ON_DEMAND\"},\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\"},{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"role\":\"model\",\"parts\":[{\"thoughtSignature\":\"\",\"functionCall\":{\"name\":\"write_file\",\"args\":{\"file_path\":\"/data/data/com.termux.nix/files/home/pick-up-nix2/vendor/nix/union/tools/rust/crane-lib/mkCleanSrc.nix\",\"content\":\"\\n{ pkgs, lib', fs, mkRootPaths, isListOf, writeTOML, readMemberCargoTomls, ... }:\\n\\nlet\\n  # build a clean source for the specified workspace members and any extra includes.\\n  mkCleanSrc =\\n    {\\n      # [path]\\n      workspaceMembers,\\n      # [path]\\n      extraIncludes,\\n\\n      # path | derivation\\n      cargoToml,\\n      # path | derivation\\n      cargoLock,\\n\\n      # bool\\n      dontRemoveDevDeps ? false,\\n      root, # Passed from mkCrane\\n    }:\\n    assert isListOf builtins.isString workspaceMembers;\\n    assert isListOf builtins.isString extraIncludes;\\n    let\\n      filteredSrc = fs.toSource {\\n        inherit root;\\n        fileset =\\n          fs.union\\n            # unconditionally include...\\n            (fs.unions (lib'.flatten [ (mkRootPaths extraIncludes) ]))\\n            # ...and include rust source of workspace deps\\n            (\\n              fs.difference\\n                (fs.intersection (fs.unions (mkRootPaths workspaceMembers)) (\\n                  fs.fileFilter (file: (builtins.any file.hasExt [ \\\"rs\\\" ])) root\\n                ))\\n                (\\n                  if dontRemoveDevDeps then\\n                    fs.unions [ ]\\n                  else\\n                    (fs.unions (\\n                      (map fs.maybeMissing (mkRootPaths (map (member: \\\"${member}/tests\\\") workspaceMembers)))\\n                      ++ (map fs.maybeMissing (mkRootPaths (map (member: \\\"${member}/examples\\\") workspaceMembers)))\\n                    ))\\n                )\\n            );\\n    in\\n    pkgs.stdenv.mkDerivation {\\n      name = \\\"clean-workspace-source\\\";\\n      src = filteredSrc;\\n      buildInputs = [ ];\\n      buildPhase = ''\\n        cp ${cargoLock} ./Cargo.lock\\n        cp ${cargoToml} ./Cargo.toml\\n\\n        ${builtins.concatStringsSep \\\"\\\\n\\\\n\\\" (\\n          lib'.mapAttrsToList (\\n            path: cargoToml:\\n            let\\n              cargoTomlPath = writeTOML \\\"Cargo.toml\\\" (\\n                builtins.removeAttrs cargoToml (lib'.optionals (!dontRemoveDevDeps) [ \\\"dev-dependencies\\\" ])\\n              );\\n            in\\n            \\\"cp ${cargoTomlPath} ./${path}/Cargo.toml\\\"\\n          ) (readMemberCargoTomls workspaceMembers)\\n        )}\\n\\n        cp -r . $out\\n      '';\\n    };\\nin\\n{\\n  inherit mkCleanSrc;\\n}\\n\"}}}]},\"finishReason\":\"STOP\"}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"promptTokenCount\":37558,\"candidatesTokenCount\":621,\"totalTokenCount\":38834,\"cachedContentTokenCount\":35757,\"trafficType\":\"ON_DEMAND\",\"promptTokensDetails\":[{\"modality\":\"TEXT\",\"tokenCount\":37558}],\"cacheTokensDetails\":[{\"modality\":\"TEXT\",\"tokenCount\":35757}],\"candidatesTokensDetails\":[{\"modality\":\"TEXT\",\"tokenCount\":621}],\"thoughtsTokenCount\":655},\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\"}]",
