    "cached_content_token_count": 43386,
    "thoughts_token_count": 1163,
    "tool_token_count": 0,
    "total_token_count": 46899,
    "response_text": "[{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"role\":\"model\",\"parts\":[{\"thought\":true,\"text\":\"**Refining the Logic**\\n\\nI've pinpointed the error in `workspace-components.nix`. It seems `crane` was incorrectly defined. I'm now certain the `crane` instance should derive from `mkCrane`, using `inputs.self` as the root and the associated `gitRev` inherited. I'm restructuring the code to reflect this corrected understanding, which should fix the build issue.\\n\\n\\n\"}]}}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"trafficType\":\"ON_DEMAND\"},\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\"},{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"role\":\"model\",\"parts\":[{\"thought\":true,\"text\":\"**Revising the Implementation**\\n\\nI've revised `workspace-components.nix` significantly. The definition of `crane` was completely misplaced and has been removed from this file. I've corrected how `allCargoTomls` references `crateCargoToml`. I'm now verifying the parameters passed to `buildWasmContract`, ensuring `buildWorkspaceMember`, `crateCargoToml`, `rust`, and `dbg` are correctly integrated.\\n\\n\\n\"}]}}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"trafficType\":\"ON_DEMAND\"},\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\"},{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"role\":\"model\",\"parts\":[{\"thought\":true,\"text\":\"**Restructuring the Dependencies**\\n\\nI've moved the dependencies on the `crane` instance, namely `workspaceCargoVendorDir` and `cargoWorkspaceAttrs`, to `crane.nix`, as these must be defined after the `crane` instance is created. This ensures the correct order of operations and resolves the prior structural issue in `workspace-components.nix`. I'm now proceeding to reconcile the configurations.\\n\\n\\n\"}]}}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"trafficType\":\"ON_DEMAND\"},\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\"},{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"role\":\"model\",\"parts\":[{\"thought\":true,\"text\":\"**Correcting and Consolidating**\\n\\nI've made a crucial mistake; the `crane` instance should *not* be in `workspace-components.nix`. I need to move the `crane` instantiation back to `crane.nix`, as `mkCrane` is defined there and requires `inputs.self` and `gitRev`. Also, I'm refactoring `allCargoTomls` to directly use `crateCargoToml`. I'll be moving helper functions for the workspace into separate files.\\n\\n\\n\"}]}}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"trafficType\":\"ON_DEMAND\"},\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\"},{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"role\":\"model\",\"parts\":[{\"thought\":true,\"text\":\"**Finalizing the Structure**\\n\\nI've fixed the major mistake in `workspace-components.nix` (now `workspace-helpers.nix`), removing the incorrect `crane` instantiation and updating `allCargoTomls`. I will move the `crane` instance and related definitions to `crane.nix`, as well as `workspaceCargoVendorDir`, `cargoWorkspaceAttrs`, and `cargoArtifacts`. I'm also preparing to break out the remaining workspace logic into separate helper files, which simplifies the overall structure.\\n\\n\\n\"}]}}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"trafficType\":\"ON_DEMAND\"},\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\"},{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"role\":\"model\",\"parts\":[{\"thoughtSignature\":\"\",\"functionCall\":{\"name\":\"write_file\",\"args\":{\"file_path\":\"/data/data/com.termux.nix/files/home/pick-up-nix2/vendor/nix/union/tools/rust/crane-lib/workspace-helpers.nix\",\"content\":\"\\n{ inputs, pkgs, lib', craneLib, mkCleanSrc,\\n  getIncludes, getExtraIncludes, crateCargoToml,\\n  workspaceCargoToml, gitRev, buildWorkspaceMember, rust, dbg, ... }:\\n\\nlet\\n  allCargoTomls = builtins.listToAttrs (\\n    map (\\n      dep: lib'.nameValuePair dep (crateCargoToml dep) # Corrected: use crateCargoToml directly\\n    ) workspaceCargoToml.workspace.members\\n  );\\n\\n  cargoWorkspaceSrc = mkCleanSrc {\\n    workspaceMembers = workspaceCargoToml.workspace.members;\\n    extraIncludes = (getIncludes allCargoTomls) ++ (getExtraIncludes allCargoTomls);\\n    cargoToml = /${inputs.self}/Cargo.toml; # Assuming inputs.self is the root of the repo\\n    cargoLock = /${inputs.self}/Cargo.lock; # Assuming inputs.self is the root of the repo\\n    dontRemoveDevDeps = true;\\n    root = inputs.self; # Pass root to mkCleanSrc\\n  };\\n\\n  buildWasmContract = import ../buildWasmContract.nix { # Relative path to original\\n    inherit\\n      buildWorkspaceMember\\n      crateCargoToml\\n      pkgs\\n      lib'\\n      rust\\n      craneLib\\n      dbg\\n      gitRev\\n      ;\\n  };\\n\\nin\\n{\\n  inherit allCargoTomls cargoWorkspaceSrc buildWasmContract;\\n}\\n\"}}}]},\"finishReason\":\"STOP\"}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"promptTokenCount\":45366,\"candidatesTokenCount\":370,\"totalTokenCount\":46899,\"cachedContentTokenCount\":43386,\"trafficType\":\"ON_DEMAND\",\"promptTokensDetails\":[{\"modality\":\"TEXT\",\"tokenCount\":45366}],\"cacheTokensDetails\":[{\"modality\":\"TEXT\",\"tokenCount\":43386}],\"candidatesTokensDetails\":[{\"modality\":\"TEXT\",\"tokenCount\":370}],\"thoughtsTokenCount\":1163},\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\"}]",
