    "response_text": "[{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"role\":\"model\",\"parts\":[{\"thought\":true,\"text\":\"**Constructing Workspace Packages**\\n\\nI'm currently working on crafting the `workspace-packages.nix` file within the Rust crane library, specifically focusing on the `packages` attribute set. My immediate task involves integrating `cargoWorkspaceAttrs` and `cargo` to define the package structure.\\n\\n\\n\"}]}}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"trafficType\":\"ON_DEMAND\"},\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\"},{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"role\":\"model\",\"parts\":[{\"thought\":true,\"text\":\"**Defining Package Attributes**\\n\\nI've initiated the creation of the `workspace-packages.nix` file within the crane library.  The objective is to establish the `packages` attribute set. My efforts now center on leveraging `cargoWorkspaceAttrs` and `cargo` to accurately represent the workspace's package hierarchy.\\n\\n\\n\"}]}}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"trafficType\":\"ON_DEMAND\"},\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\"},{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"role\":\"model\",\"parts\":[{\"thought\":true,\"text\":\"**Integrating Docs Generation**\\n\\nI'm now focusing on integrating the documentation generation process within `workspace-packages.nix`. I'm leveraging the `crane.lib.cargoDoc` function, configuring it with `cargoWorkspaceAttrs` and additional parameters. My goal is to create documentation for all workspace members.\\n\\n\\n\"}]},\"citationMetadata\":{\"citations\":[{\"startIndex\":2019,\"endIndex\":2393,\"uri\":\"https://github.daw.org.cn/unionlabs/union/blob/main/tools/rust/crane.nix\"}]}}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"trafficType\":\"ON_DEMAND\"},\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\"},{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"role\":\"model\",\"parts\":[{\"thought\":true,\"text\":\"**Structuring Package Definitions**\\n\\nI'm now generating the `workspace-packages.nix` file to configure the `packages` attribute set, which will include the `check-all-workspace-members-individually`,  and `rust-docs` definitions. I'm focusing on incorporating `crane.lib.cargoDoc` to generate documentation.\\n\\n\\n\"}]},\"citationMetadata\":{\"citations\":[{\"startIndex\":2019,\"endIndex\":3565,\"title\":\"Your prompt\"}]}}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"trafficType\":\"ON_DEMAND\"},\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\"},{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"role\":\"model\",\"parts\":[{\"thought\":true,\"text\":\"**Defining Core Attributes**\\n\\nI'm now implementing the `tools/rust/crane-lib/workspace-packages.nix` file, defining the `packages` attribute set. I've begun to incorporate key definitions, including `check-all-workspace-members-individually` and `rust-docs` using `crane.lib.cargoDoc`, alongside configurations for potential future coverage reports.\\n\\n\\n\"}]}}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"trafficType\":\"ON_DEMAND\"},\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\"},{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"role\":\"model\",\"parts\":[{\"thoughtSignature\":\"\",\"functionCall\":{\"name\":\"write_file\",\"args\":{\"content\":\"\\n{ pkgs, lib', crane, cargoWorkspaceAttrs, cargoArtifacts, workspaceCargoVendorDir, inputs, mkCrane, ... }:\\n\\n{\\n  rust-lib = pkgs.mkRootDrv \\\"rust-lib\\\" {\\n    inherit mkCrane; # mkCrane will be passed from the main crane.nix\\n  };\\n  # cleanCargoLock = writeTOML \\\"Cargo.lock\\\" (cleanCargoLock [ \\\"ibc-union\\\" ]);\\n  # cleanCargoLock = writeTOML \\\"Cargo.lock\\\" (\\n  #   cleanCargoLock (\\n  #     builtins.attrNames (\\n  #       ((crateCargoToml \\\"cosmwasm/ibc-union/core\\\").dependencies or { })\\n  #       // ((crateCargoToml \\\"cosmwasm/ibc-union/core\\\").build-dependencies or { })\\n  #       // (lib.optionalAttrs false (crateCargoToml \\\"cosmwasm/ibc-union/core\\\").dev-dependencies or { })\\n  #     )\\n  #   )\\n  # );\\n  # getAllDeps = dbg (getAllDeps [ \\\"cosmwasm/ibc-union/core\\\" ]);\\n  # getDependency = dbg (\\n  #   getCargoLockPackageEntry \\\"static_assertions 1.1.0 (registry+https://github.com/rust-lang/crates.io-index)\\\"\\n  # );\\n  # normalizedCargoLock = writeJSON \\\"normalized-Cargo.lock.json\\\" normalizedCargoLock;\\n  check-all-workspace-members-individually = pkgs.writeShellApplication {\\n    name = \\\"check-all-workspace-members-individually\\\";\\n    text = ''\\n      cargo metadata --no-deps | jq '.workspace_members[]' -r | xargs -I{} cargo check -p {}\\n    '';\\n  };\\n\\n  rust-docs = crane.lib.cargoDoc (\\n    cargoWorkspaceAttrs\\n    // {\\n      pname = \\\"rust-docs\\\";\\n      version = \\\"0.0.0\\\";\\n      src = crane.cargoWorkspaceSrc;\\n      cargoVendorDir = workspaceCargoVendorDir;\\n      inherit cargoArtifacts;\\n      cargoDocExtraArgs = \\\"--workspace\\\";\\n      RUSTDOCFLAGS = \\\"-Z unstable-options --enable-index-page\\\";\\n    }\\n  );\\n\\n  # FIXME: currently ICE, https://github.com/unionlabs/union/actions/runs/8882618404/job/24387814904\\n  # packages.rust-coverage =\\n  #   let\\n  #     crane.lib = crane.lib.${system}.overrideToolchain rust.toolchains.dev;\\n  #   in\\n  #   crane.lib.cargoLlvmCov {\\n  #     pname = \\\"workspace-cargo-llvm-cov\\\";\\n  #     version = \\\"0.0.0\\\";\\n  #     cargoLlvmCovExtraArgs = lib.concatStringsSep \\\" \\\" [\\n  #       \\\"--workspace\\\"\\n  #       \\\"--html\\\"\\n  #       \\\"--output-dir=$out\\\"\\n  #       \\\"--ignore-filename-regex='((nix/store)|(generated))/.+'\\\"\\n  #       \\\"--exclude=parse-wasm-client-type\\\"\\n  #       \\\"--exclude=protos\\\"\\n  #       \\\"--exclude=contracts\\\"\\n  #       \\\"--exclude=unionvisor\\\" # TODO: Figure out why unionvisor tests are flakey\\n  #       \\\"--exclude=tidy\\\"\\n  #       \\\"--exclude=generate-rust-sol-bindings\\\"\\n  #       \\\"--exclude=ensure-blocks\\\"\\n  #       \\\"--hide-instantiations\\\"\\n  #     ];\\n  #     SQLX_OFFLINE = true;\\n  #     cargoArtifacts = craneLib.buildDepsOnly {\\n  #       pname = \\\"workspace-build-deps-only\\\";\\n  #       version = \\\"0.0.0\\\";\\n  #       cargoExtraArgs = \\\"--locked\\\";\\n  #       doCheck = false;\\n\\n  #       buildInputs = [ pkgs.pkg-config pkgs.openssl ] ++ (\\n  #         lib.optionals pkgs.stdenv.isDarwin [ pkgs.darwin.apple_sdk.frameworks.Security ]\\n  #       );\\n  #       src = cargoWorkspaceSrc;\\n  #     };\\n  #     preBuild = ''\\n  #       cp --no-preserve=mode ${self'.packages.uniond}/bin/uniond $(pwd)/unionvisor/src/testdata/test_init_cmd/bundle/bins/genesis\\n  #       echo 'patching testdata'\\n  #       patchShebangs $(pwd)/unionvisor/src/testdata\\n  #     '';\\n  #     ICS23_TEST_SUITE_DATA_DIR = \\\"${inputs.ics23}/testdata\\\";\\n  #     ETHEREUM_CONSENSUS_SPECS_DIR = \\\"${inputs.ethereum-consensus-specs}\\\";\\n\\n  #     buildInputs = [ pkgs.pkg-config pkgs.openssl ] ++ (\\n  #       lib.optionals pkgs.stdenv.isDarwin [ pkgs.darwin.apple_sdk.frameworks.Security ]\\n  #     );\\n  #     src = cargoWorkspaceSrc;\\n  #   };\\n}\\n\",\"file_path\":\"/data/data/com.termux.nix/files/home/pick-up-nix2/vendor/nix/union/tools/rust/crane-lib/workspace-packages.nix\"}}}]},\"finishReason\":\"STOP\"}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"promptTokenCount\":46628,\"candidatesTokenCount\":1211,\"totalTokenCount\":49096,\"cachedContentTokenCount\":45118,\"trafficType\":\"ON_DEMAND\",\"promptTokensDetails\":[{\"modality\":\"TEXT\",\"tokenCount\":46628}],\"cacheTokensDetails\":[{\"modality\":\"TEXT\",\"tokenCount\":45118}],\"candidatesTokensDetails\":[{\"modality\":\"TEXT\",\"tokenCount\":1211}],\"thoughtsTokenCount\":1257},\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\"}]",
