    "response_text": "[{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"role\":\"model\",\"parts\":[{\"thought\":true,\"text\":\"**Isolating Dependency Usage**\\n\\nI'm now focusing on separating the `openssl` and `pkg-config` dependencies into a dedicated Nix file for reusability. The primary goal is to create a modular component, perhaps a function or module, that encapsulates these dependencies. This should enable easy integration via `buildInputs` or `nativeBuildInputs` within other Nix expressions. Revisiting `crane.nix` from earlier seems like a useful reference point.\\n\\n\\n\"}]}}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"trafficType\":\"ON_DEMAND\"},\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\"},{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"role\":\"model\",\"parts\":[{\"thought\":true,\"text\":\"**Deconstructing Existing References**\\n\\nI'm presently examining how `openssl` and `pkg-config` are integrated within the `crane.nix` file to better comprehend the context. I've noted several instances in `buildWorkspaceMember`, `cargoWorkspaceAttrs`, and `packages.rust-coverage`, allowing me to identify common usage patterns and how environment variables are set. This analysis is guiding the design of the reusable component.\\n\\n\\n\"}]}}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"trafficType\":\"ON_DEMAND\"},\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\"},{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"role\":\"model\",\"parts\":[{\"thought\":true,\"text\":\"**Designing a Nix Abstraction**\\n\\nI've been examining the usage patterns of `openssl` and `pkg-config` from the provided references. I've sketched a `tools/rust/common-rust-deps.nix` file. This should export `commonBuildInputs` and `pkgConfigPath`, factoring out the repeated dependency declarations. I'll need to modify the `crane.nix` file now to import and use the attributes defined in the new file, rather than declaring those dependencies repeatedly.\\n\\n\\n\"}]}}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"trafficType\":\"ON_DEMAND\"},\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\"},{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"role\":\"model\",\"parts\":[{\"thought\":true,\"text\":\"**Formulating a Plan**\\n\\nI'm developing the `tools/rust/common-rust-deps.nix` file now, exporting `commonBuildInputs` (containing `pkg-config`, `openssl`, and conditional Darwin dependencies) and `pkgConfigPath`. This module will simplify the `crane.nix` file, reducing repetition. I'll then demonstrate how the refactored `crane.nix` would import and leverage this new module to clean up the code.\\n\\n\\n\"}]}}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"trafficType\":\"ON_DEMAND\"},\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\"},{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"role\":\"model\",\"parts\":[{\"thoughtSignature\":\"\",\"text\":\"Okay, I can extract the usage of `openssl` and `pkg-config` into a reusable Nix file.\\n\\nI will create a new file named `tools/rust/common-rust-deps.nix` that exports an attribute set containing the common build inputs and the `PKG_CONFIG_PATH\"}]}}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"trafficType\":\"ON_DEMAND\"},\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\"},{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"role\":\"model\",\"parts\":[{\"text\":\"` related to `openssl`.\\n\\nHere's the content for the new file:\\n\\n```nix\\n{ pkgs, lib, ... }:\\n\\nlet\\n  commonBuildInputs = [\\n    pkgs.pkg-config\\n    pkgs.openssl\\n  ] ++ (lib.optionals pkgs.stden\"}]}}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"trafficType\":\"ON_DEMAND\"},\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\"},{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"role\":\"model\",\"parts\":[{\"text\":\"v.isDarwin [ pkgs.darwin.apple_sdk.frameworks.Security ]);\\n\\n  pkgConfigPath = \\\"${pkgs.openssl.dev}/lib/pkgconfig\\\";\\n\\nin\\n{\\n  inherit commonBuildInputs pkgConfigPath;\\n}\\n```\\n\\nI will now create this file.\"}]}}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"trafficType\":\"ON_DEMAND\"},\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\"},{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"role\":\"model\",\"parts\":[{\"functionCall\":{\"name\":\"write_file\",\"args\":{\"file_path\":\"/data/data/com.termux.nix/files/home/pick-up-nix2/vendor/nix/union/tools/rust/common-rust-deps.nix\",\"content\":\"\\n{ pkgs, lib, ... }:\\n\\nlet\\n  commonBuildInputs = [\\n    pkgs.pkg-config\\n    pkgs.openssl\\n  ] ++ (lib.optionals pkgs.stdenv.isDarwin [ pkgs.darwin.apple_sdk.frameworks.Security ]);\\n\\n  pkgConfigPath = \\\"${pkgs.openssl.dev}/lib/pkgconfig\\\";\\n\\nin\\n{\\n  inherit commonBuildInputs pkgConfigPath;\\n}\\n\"}}}]},\"finishReason\":\"STOP\"}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"promptTokenCount\":68671,\"candidatesTokenCount\":340,\"totalTokenCount\":69786,\"cachedContentTokenCount\":50883,\"trafficType\":\"ON_DEMAND\",\"promptTokensDetails\":[{\"modality\":\"TEXT\",\"tokenCount\":68671}],\"cacheTokensDetails\":[{\"modality\":\"TEXT\",\"tokenCount\":50883}],\"candidatesTokensDetails\":[{\"modality\":\"TEXT\",\"tokenCount\":340}],\"thoughtsTokenCount\":775},\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\"}]",
