    "response_text": "[{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"role\":\"model\",\"parts\":[{\"thought\":true,\"text\":\"**Describing Usage in Crane**\\n\\nI've been working on how to integrate the new `common-rust-deps.nix` file into `crane.nix`. I'm focusing on clarifying how `commonBuildInputs` and `pkgConfigPath` are used within the `crane.nix` context. Next, I'll provide concise, practical examples.\\n\\n\\n\"}]}}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"trafficType\":\"ON_DEMAND\"},\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\"},{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"role\":\"model\",\"parts\":[{\"thought\":true,\"text\":\"**Clarifying Crane Integration**\\n\\nI'm presently reframing the steps to integrate the new dependencies into `crane.nix`. I've outlined the import of `common-rust-deps.nix`, specifying how to access `commonBuildInputs` and `pkgConfigPath`. Next, I will refactor the existing `buildInputs` within the `crane.nix` file using the new variables, providing code examples to facilitate their understanding and practical application.\\n\\n\\n\"}]}}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"trafficType\":\"ON_DEMAND\"},\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\"},{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"role\":\"model\",\"parts\":[{\"thought\":true,\"text\":\"**Implementing PKG_CONFIG_PATH**\\n\\nI'm now focusing on integrating `pkgConfigPath` into `crane.nix`. After importing `common-rust-deps.nix` and integrating `commonBuildInputs`, I will show how to utilize `pkgConfigPath`. This involves replacing existing `PKG_CONFIG_PATH` assignments with the new variable. I'll provide clear examples, ensuring the changes are easy to understand.\\n\\n\\n\"}]}}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"trafficType\":\"ON_DEMAND\"},\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\"},{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"role\":\"model\",\"parts\":[{\"thought\":true,\"text\":\"**Explaining Integration Steps**\\n\\nI'm presently outlining the practical steps to integrate `common-rust-deps.nix` into `crane.nix`. This involves importing the file and using its attributes, specifically `commonBuildInputs` and `pkgConfigPath`. I'll provide clear examples showing the replacement of existing `buildInputs` and `PKG_CONFIG_PATH` assignments. Since I'm refactoring `crane.nix`, these changes will be applied later, after the refactoring is complete.\\n\\n\\n\"}]}}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"trafficType\":\"ON_DEMAND\"},\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\"},{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"role\":\"model\",\"parts\":[{\"thoughtSignature\":\"\",\"text\":\"The `tools/rust/common-rust-deps.nix` file now provides reusable definitions for common Rust build dependencies. Here's how you would integrate it into your `crane.nix` (or its refactored components):\\n\\n1.  **Import `common-rust-deps.\"}]}}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"trafficType\":\"ON_DEMAND\"},\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\"},{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"role\":\"model\",\"parts\":[{\"text\":\"nix`:**\\n    At the top of the relevant Nix file (e.g., `crane.nix` or `crane-lib/buildWorkspaceMember.nix` where `buildInputs` are defined), add an import statement:\\n\\n    ```nix\\n    # Example: In crane.nix\"}]}}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"trafficType\":\"ON_DEMAND\"},\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\"},{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"role\":\"model\",\"parts\":[{\"text\":\" or a crane-lib file\\n    let\\n      # Assuming 'pkgs' and 'lib' are in scope\\n      commonRustDeps = import ./common-rust-deps.nix { inherit pkgs lib; };\\n      inherit (commonRustDeps) commonBuildInputs pkgConfigPath;\\n    in\\n    \"}]}}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"trafficType\":\"ON_DEMAND\"},\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\"},{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"role\":\"model\",\"parts\":[{\"text\":\"# ... rest of your Nix code\\n    ```\\n\\n2.  **Replace `buildInputs`:**\\n    Substitute the explicit `pkgs.pkg-config` and `pkgs.openssl` in `buildInputs` lists with `commonBuildInputs`.\\n\\n    **Original `buildInputs` example (from `buildWorkspaceMember\"}]}}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"trafficType\":\"ON_DEMAND\"},\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\"},{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"role\":\"model\",\"parts\":[{\"text\":\"`):**\\n    ```nix\\n                buildInputs =\\n                  [\\n                    pkgs.pkg-config\\n                    pkgs.openssl\\n                  ]\\n                  ++ (lib'.optionals pkgs.stdenv.isDarwin [ pkgs.darwin.apple_sdk.frameworks.Security ])\\n                  ++\"}]}}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"trafficType\":\"ON_DEMAND\"},\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\"},{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"role\":\"model\",\"parts\":[{\"text\":\" extraBuildInputs;\\n    ```\\n    **Modified `buildInputs` example:**\\n    ```nix\\n                buildInputs = commonBuildInputs ++ extraBuildInputs;\\n    ```\\n    Similarly, for `cargoWorkspaceAttrs`:\\n    **Original `buildInputs` example:**\\n    ```nix\\n            \"}]}}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"trafficType\":\"ON_DEMAND\"},\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\"},{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"role\":\"model\",\"parts\":[{\"text\":\"buildInputs = [\\n              pkgs.pkg-config\\n              pkgs.perl\\n              pkgs.openssl\\n              pkgs.protobuf\\n              pkgs.perl\\n              pkgs.gnumake\\n              pkgs.systemd\\n            ] ++ (pkgs.lib.optionals pkgs\"}]}}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"trafficType\":\"ON_DEMAND\"},\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\"},{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"role\":\"model\",\"parts\":[{\"text\":\".stdenv.isDarwin [ pkgs.darwin.apple_sdk.frameworks.Security ]);\\n    ```\\n    **Modified `buildInputs` example:**\\n    ```nix\\n            buildInputs = commonBuildInputs ++ [\\n              pkgs.perl\\n              pkgs.protobuf\\n              pkgs\"}]}}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"trafficType\":\"ON_DEMAND\"},\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\"},{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"role\":\"model\",\"parts\":[{\"text\":\".perl\\n              pkgs.gnumake\\n              pkgs.systemd\\n            ];\\n    ```\\n\\n3.  **Replace `PKG_CONFIG_PATH`:*