    "response_text": "[{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"role\":\"model\",\"parts\":[{\"thought\":true,\"text\":\"**Refining User Intent**\\n\\nI've finally grasped the user's requirements. The goal isn't to alter `crane.nix`. Rather, I should create `crane-lattice.nix`, a new file that assembles the other modules into a cohesive lattice structure. This composition is key.\\n\\n\\n\"}]}}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"trafficType\":\"ON_DEMAND\"},\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\"},{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"role\":\"model\",\"parts\":[{\"thought\":true,\"text\":\"**Formulating Module Composition**\\n\\nI'm solidifying the structure. The core is `mkCraneLattice`, the top-level function in `crane-lattice.nix`. This will act like the original `mkCrane`, but it orchestrates the smaller modules. It seems sensible to pass the inputs and other args directly, mirroring the original approach. I'm focusing on ensuring seamless argument propagation throughout the component modules.\\n\\n\\n\"}]}}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"trafficType\":\"ON_DEMAND\"},\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\"},{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"role\":\"model\",\"parts\":[{\"thought\":true,\"text\":\"**Architecting the Composition**\\n\\nI'm presently building `crane-lattice.nix`. I've outlined `mkCraneLattice`, which accepts arguments and imports the sub-modules. The plan is to mimic the argument passing style of the original `crane.nix`. Next, I must link dependencies between modules within `crane-lattice.nix`, such as the cargo toml parsing functions.\\n\\n\\n\"}]}}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"trafficType\":\"ON_DEMAND\"},\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\"},{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"role\":\"model\",\"parts\":[{\"thought\":true,\"text\":\"**Designing `crane-lattice.nix`**\\n\\nI'm focused on the structure of `crane-lattice.nix`. I'm starting with `mkCraneLattice`, accepting `root` and `gitRev`. It imports the smaller modules, carefully passing necessary arguments and dependencies, such as `pkgs`, `rust`, and `lib`.  I plan to mimic argument passing in the original `crane.nix`. I've outlined the function calls, so now I'll address argument propagation.\\n\\n\\n\"}]}}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"trafficType\":\"ON_DEMAND\"},\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\"},{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"role\":\"model\",\"parts\":[{\"thought\":true,\"text\":\"**Designing `crane-lattice.nix`**\\n\\nI'm starting with implementing `crane-lattice.nix`, as outlined. I'm focusing on the `mkCraneLattice` function, ensuring it accepts `root` and `gitRev` arguments. I'm importing the smaller modules, and will mirror argument-passing from the original `crane.nix`. I've outlined the structure and function calls. The next step involves propagating dependencies between modules, especially cargo toml parsing functions.\\n\\n\\n\"}]}}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"trafficType\":\"ON_DEMAND\"},\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\"},{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"role\":\"model\",\"parts\":[{\"thought\":true,\"text\":\"**Outlining the Implementation**\\n\\nI'm developing the `crane-lattice.nix` structure, creating `mkCraneLattice`, which will accept arguments like `root` and `gitRev`, and import sub-modules. It'll mirror `crane.nix`'s argument-passing style. My current focus: Ensure dependency injection between modules, especially linking to the cargo toml parsing functions.\\n\\n\\n\"}]}}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"trafficType\":\"ON_DEMAND\"},\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\"},{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"role\":\"model\",\"parts\":[{\"thought\":true,\"text\":\"**Designing the Lattice Module**\\n\\nI'm presently building `crane-lattice.nix`. I've outlined `mkCraneLattice`, which accepts arguments and imports the sub-modules. The plan is to mimic the argument passing style of the original `crane.nix`. Next, I must link dependencies between modules within `crane-lattice.nix`, such as the cargo toml parsing functions.\\n\\n\\n\"}]}}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"trafficType\":\"ON_DEMAND\"},\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\"},{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"role\":\"model\",\"parts\":[{\"thought\":true,\"text\":\"**Constructing the Module Lattice**\\n\\nI'm now fully immersed in building `crane-lattice.nix`.  I've defined `mkCraneLattice`, which accepts `root` and `gitRev` and imports submodules. I'm focusing on seamless argument propagation, and I'll include `common-rust-deps.nix` for dependency management. Currently, I'm integrating the `workspaceHelpers` module and its dependencies.\\n\\n\\n\"}]}}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"trafficType\":\"ON_DEMAND\"},\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\"},{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"role\":\"model\",\"parts\":[{\"thoughtSignature\":\"\",\"functionCall\":{\"name\":\"write_file\",\"args\":{\"content\":\"# tools/rust/crane-lattice.nix\\n{\\n  inputs,\\n  ...\\n}:\\n{\\n  perSystem =\\n    args@{\\n      pkgs,\\n      rust,\\n      dbg,\\n      gitRev,\\n      lib, # The original lib from args\\n      ...\\n    }:\\n    let\\n      # Import common rust dependencies\\n      commonRustDeps = import ./common-rust-deps.nix { inherit pkgs lib; };\\n      inherit (commonRustDeps) commonBuildInputs pkgConfigPath;\\n\\n      # Import all the smaller modules, passing necessary arguments\\n      # Note: 'root' will be passed to mkCraneLattice, not directly here\\n      utils = import ./crane-lib/utils.nix { inherit pkgs args; lib = lib; root = null; };\\n      inherit (utils) fs writeTOML lib' isListOf mkRootPath mkRootPaths;\\n\\n      cargoTomlParsing = import ./crane-lib/cargo-toml-parsing.nix { inherit pkgs lib' root; };\\n      inherit (cargoTomlParsing) getCraneMetadata getExtraIncludes getIncludes readMemberCargoTomls crateCargoToml workspaceCargoToml;\\n\\n      cargoLockParsing = import ./crane-lib/cargo-lock-parsing.nix { inherit pkgs lib' root; };\\n      inherit (cargoLockParsing) normalizedCargoLock getCargoLockPackageEntry getAllPackageDependencies cleanCargoLock;\\n\\n      dependencyResolution = import ./crane-lib/dependency-resolution.nix { inherit lib' crateCargoToml workspaceCargoToml; };\\n      inherit (dependencyResolution) getMemberDeps getAllDeps;\\n\\n      mkCleanSrcModule = import ./crane-lib/mkCleanSrc.nix { inherit pkgs lib' fs mkRootPaths isListOf writeTOML readMemberCargoTomls; };\\n      mkCleanSrc = mkCleanSrcModule.mkCleanSrc;\\n\\n      buildWorkspaceMemberModule = import ./crane-lib/buildWorkspaceMember.nix {\\n        inherit pkgs lib' rust inputs craneLib dbg gitRev\\n          isListOf crateCargoToml workspaceCargoToml getMemberDeps getAllDeps\\n          cleanCargoLock writeTOML readMemberCargoTomls mkCleanSrc\\n          getIncludes getExtraIncludes;\\n        root = null; # root will be passed to mkCraneLattice\\n      };\\n      buildWorkspaceMember = buildWorkspaceMemberModule.buildWorkspaceMember;\\n\\n      # Define mkCraneLattice function\\n      mkCraneLattice =\\n        {\\n          root,\\n          gitRev,\\n        }:\\n        let\\n          craneLib = (inputs.crane.mkLib pkgs).overrideToolchain (_: rust.toolchains.nightly);\\n\\n          workspaceHelpers = import ./crane-lib/workspace-helpers.nix {\\n            inherit inputs pkgs lib' craneLib mkCleanSrc\\n              getIncludes getExtraIncludes crateCargoToml\\n              workspaceCargoToml gitRev buildWorkspaceMember rust dbg;\\n            root = root;\\n          };\\n          inherit (workspaceHelpers) allCargoTomls cargoWorkspaceSrc buildWasmContract;\\n\\n          workspaceCargoVendorDir = craneLib.vendorCargoDeps {\\n            src = cargoWorkspaceSrc;\\n            overrideVendorGitCheckout =\\n              ps: drv:\\n              if pkgs.lib.any (p: (pkgs.lib.hasInfix \\\"zhiburt/tabled\\\" p.source)) ps then\\n                drv.overrideAttrs (_old: {\\n                  postPatch = ''\\n                    # broken symlink or something idk\\n                    # https://github.com/ipetkov/crane/issues/802\\n                    # https://github.com/zhiburt/tabled/issues/538\\n                    rm tabled/examples/show/LICENSE\\n                  '';\\n                })\\n              else\\n                # Nothing to change, leave the derivations as is\\n                drv;\\n          };\\n\\n          cargoWorkspaceAttrs = {\\n            pname = \\\"cargo-workspace\\\";\\n            version = \\\"0.0.0\\\";\\n            src = cargoWorkspaceSrc;\\n\\n            # unionvisor is tested individually, and mpc* crates attempt to link to galoisd (and don't have any tests anyways).\\n            cargoTestExtraArgs = \\\"--workspace --all-features --exclude 'mpc*' --exclude unionvisor --exclude union-test --no-fail-fast\\\";\\n            cargoClippyExtraArgs = \\\"--workspace --tests --all-features -- -Dwarnings\\\";\\n\\n            CARGO_PROFILE = \\\"dev\\\";\\n            SQLX_OFFLINE = true;\\n            PKG_CONFIG_PATH = pkgConfigPath; # Using common-rust-deps\\n            LIBCLANG_PATH = \\\"${pkgs.llvmPackages_14.libclang.lib}/lib\\\";\\n            ICS23_TEST_SUITE_DATA_DIR = \\\"${inputs.ics23}/testdata\\\";\\n\\n            buildInputs = commonBuildInputs ++ [\\n              pkgs.perl\\n              pkgs.protobuf\\n              pkgs.perl\\n              pkgs.gnumake\\n              pkgs.systemd\\n            ]; # Using common-rust-deps\\n            nativeBuildInputs = [\\n              pkgs.clang\\n            ];\\n            cargoVendorDir = workspaceCargoVendorDir;\\n          };\\n          cargoArtifacts = craneLib.buildDepsOnly cargoWorkspaceAttrs;\\n\\n        in\\n        {\\n          inherit\\n            cargoWorkspaceSrc\\n            buildWorkspaceMember\\n            buildWasmContract\\n            allCargoTomls\\n            craneLib # Export craneLib as well\\n            workspaceCargoVendorDir\\n            cargoWorkspaceAttrs\\n            cargoArtifacts\\n            ;\\n          lib = craneLib; # This seems redundant with craneLib above, but matches original\\n        };\\n\\n      crane = mkCraneLattice {\\n        root = ../../.; # Assuming this is the correct root for the original crane.nix context\\n        inherit (args) gitRev;\\n      };\\n\\n    in\\n    {\\n      _module.args = {\\n        inherit crane mkCraneLattice;\\n      };\\n\\n      checks = import ./crane-lib/workspace-checks.nix {\\n        inherit pkgs lib' crane cargoWorkspaceAttrs cargoArtifacts allCargoTomls dbg;\\n      };\\n\\n      packages = import ./crane-lib/workspace-packages.nix {\\n        inherit pkgs lib' crane cargoWorkspaceAttrs cargoArtifacts workspaceCargoVendorDir inputs mkCraneLattice;\\n      };\\n    };\\n}\\n\",\"file_path\":\"/data/data/com.termux.nix/files/home/pick-up-nix2/vendor/nix/union/tools/rust/crane-lattice.nix\"}}}]},\"finishReason\":\"STOP\"}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"promptTokenCount\":70790,\"candidatesTokenCount\":1409,\"totalTokenCount\":74036,\"cachedContentTokenCount\":68724,\"trafficType\":\"ON_DEMAND\",\"promptTokensDetails\":[{\"modality\":\"TEXT\",\"tokenCount\":70790}],\"cacheTokensDetails\":[{\"modality\":\"TEXT\",\"tokenCount\":68724}],\"candidatesTokensDetails\":[{\"modality\":\"TEXT\",\"tokenCount\":1409}],\"thoughtsTokenCount\":1837},\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\"}]",
