    "response_text": "[{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"role\":\"model\",\"parts\":[{\"thought\":true,\"text\":\"**Initiating the Commit**\\n\\nI'm now staging all changes and preparing to commit them. The next step is crafting a descriptive commit message that will fully capture the nature of these modifications. Hopefully, I can find the appropriate words quickly.\\n\\n\\n\"}]}}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"trafficType\":\"ON_DEMAND\"},\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\"},{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"role\":\"model\",\"parts\":[{\"thoughtSignature\":\"CiQB4/H/Xq+oHowwLHKuq+g+qTNQqjNtJCrE4tdyKwA4S5SRtocKaAHj8f9ezw56XmARZo6hG/L4vVINcLxvoCHZ56m0B3bXW+jlNHUP8h0IqGbnP6b0+VTSGnMF+BIcPamV9+EIZIrVXyG4c0D+LVYXHvg3TPJvrlwmod4W3LkNfPNaJ28o6FJaEbvr9rx/\",\"functionCall\":{\"name\":\"run_shell_command\",\"args\":{\"command\":\"git commit -m \\\"feat: Refactor crane.nix into modular lattice and extract common Rust dependencies\\n\\nThis commit introduces a modular refactoring of the Nix-based Rust build system.\\n\\n- **New `crane-lattice.nix`:** A new file `tools/rust/crane-lattice.nix` has been created. This file composes smaller, logically grouped Nix modules (located in `tools/rust/crane-lib/`) to provide the functionality previously found in `crane.nix`. This improves modularity, readability, and reusability.\\n\\n- **Extracted `common-rust-deps.nix`:** The `tools/rust/common-rust-deps.nix` file has been created to centralize the definition of common Rust build inputs (like `openssl` and `pkg-config`) and related environment variables (`PKG_CONFIG_PATH`). This promotes reuse across different Rust projects.\\n\\n- **Updated `README.md`:** The `tools/rust/README.md` has been updated to document the purpose and usage of both `common-rust-deps.nix` and `crane-lattice.nix`.\\n\\nThis change does not modify the original `crane.nix` but provides an alternative, more modular approach for building Rust projects within the Nix ecosystem.\\\" \",\"description\":\"Commit the staged changes with a detailed message explaining the refactoring and new files.\"}}}]},\"finishReason\":\"STOP\"}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"promptTokenCount\":73661,\"candidatesTokenCount\":288,\"totalTokenCount\":73966,\"cachedContentTokenCount\":73411,\"trafficType\":\"ON_DEMAND\",\"promptTokensDetails\":[{\"modality\":\"TEXT\",\"tokenCount\":73661}],\"cacheTokensDetails\":[{\"modality\":\"TEXT\",\"tokenCount\":73411}],\"candidatesTokensDetails\":[{\"modality\":\"TEXT\",\"tokenCount\":288}],\"thoughtsTokenCount\":17},\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\"}]",
